+          "$comment": "Argo's own entry: registered, from ArgoCDDeploy, and never auto-syncing, since a self-sync can restart the controller or the repo-server mid-sync (D3). Deleting its stage would leave argocd-prd requiring pruning, and the prune would delete Argo.",
+          "allOf": [
